---
/** Compact methodology reminder for hub pages — links to the full page. */
---

<aside class="rounded-card border border-line bg-surface p-5">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] bg-brand-wash text-brand" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path>
          <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">
        Every listing here passes four checks — identity, license, reviews, responsiveness —
        before it earns a badge.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a href="/how-we-verify" class="rounded-chip border border-line-strong px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ink hover:bg-inset">
      How we verify
    </a>
  </div>
</aside>
